      "review_summary": "The branch sets Kimi K2 metadata to expose `https://kimi-k2.ai/api/user/credits` as a Usage Dashboard URL, adds a MenuDescriptor test, updates metadata assertions, and edits `CHANGELOG.md`.\n\nReproducibility: yes. for the PR defect: source shows Usage Dashboard opens metadata URLs directly through `NSWorkspace`, the Kimi K2 docs require a bearer API key for this endpoint, and a no-auth request returns HTTP 401 JSON. I did not run the native app because this is a read-only review.",
      "review_followup": "- [P1] A maintainer needs to decide whether the unofficial Kimi K2 provider should expose any dashboard shortcut and which browser-safe URL is acceptable before automation can safely repair the branch.",
